  "name": "Chicken Pot Pie",
  "subtitle": "A savory chicken and vegetable pie with a creamy herb filling.",
  "description": "Tender chicken, vegetables, and parsley are folded into a light broth-based sauce, enclosed in whole wheat crust, and baked until golden.",
